re the downloaded git repository (`llama.cpp`) resides.\n*   **`-B \"${srcdir}/build\"`**: Specifies the **build directory**. CMake will generate all intermediate files (object files, makefiles, etc.) here, keeping the source tree clean.\n*   **`-G Ninja`**: Sets the build backend to **Ninja**. Ninja is generally faster than Make for large C++ projects like llama.cpp.\n\n### 3. Compiler and Build Type Flags\n```bash\n    -"}